### 总览（看当前 style）
GET http://localhost:8025/api/exception/overview
X-Trace-Id: demo-trace-001

### 订单存在
GET http://localhost:8025/api/exception/orders/1001

### 订单不存在 → 404 + code=20404
GET http://localhost:8025/api/exception/orders/999999

### 取消已取消订单 → 409
POST http://localhost:8025/api/exception/orders/1002/cancel

### 创建成功
POST http://localhost:8025/api/exception/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-A",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 校验失败 → 400 + errors[]
POST http://localhost:8025/api/exception/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "",
  "quantity": 0
}

### 库存不足 → 400 + code=20400
POST http://localhost:8025/api/exception/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "SKU-A",
  "quantity": 101
}

### 无权限 → 403
GET http://localhost:8025/api/exception/forbidden

### 系统异常兜底 → 500（无堆栈）
GET http://localhost:8025/api/exception/boom

### 缺少参数
GET http://localhost:8025/api/exception/need-param

###
### ProblemDetail 模式：
### cmd /c "mvn -pl springboot-web-exception spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.arguments=--spring.profiles.active=problem"
###
